          <span class="fc-indicator state-NOT_OBSERVED">Emergency Knesset convening attempt post-dissolution</span>
          <span class="fc-indicator state-NOT_OBSERVED">Direct Iranian ballistic or cruise strike on Israeli civilian population center</span>
        </div>
