      <p class="scenario-line"><strong class="label-prot">Protracted path (60%):</strong> Derived as residual; kinetic exchange persists at the current four-night-on, pause rhythm with neither escalation to a widened confrontation nor a formal ceasefire, as courier diplomacy buys time without producing a convened session.</p>
      <p class="scenario-line"><strong class="label-desc">De-escalation path (5%):</strong> Derived from P(F9=YES) × P(F8=YES) × P(F10=NO) ≈ 0.30 × 0.30 × 0.50; requires Qatar mediators to secure a confirmed readout within 72 hours, a new convened session within 12 days, and no further IRGC vessel attacks — all three conditions currently unmet.</p>
    </div>
